  "notes": "Route B (owner's choice, 2026-10-23): a strong Traditional Chinese model with the least training, by continuing the pretraining of an open Apache-2.0 base (Google Gemma 4 E4B) on Taiwanese data (docs/CPT_PLAN_B.md). Gated on every task the repo can score today, same scorer and shots for every model, 'pass' = 95% paired-bootstrap lower bound of (HeliosLM-B - baseline) above the margin with HeliosLM-B averaged over three seeds. Taiwanese reference models: Breexe-8x7B (paper numbers for orientation only: TMMLU+ 48.9, MMLU 69.9, MT-Bench-tw 7.2), Breeze 2 8B, Breeze 2 3B, Breeze-7B. The base itself is gated too, so the release has to add something: it must score above Gemma 4 E4B (base) on the two Taiwanese tasks (TMMLU+, TW-JusticeBench) and lose at most 2 points on C-Eval / CMMLU (forgetting check). MMLU, MT-Bench-tw and the function-calling boards join as gated tasks when the repo has scorers for them (re-locks the plan; allowed until B1 training starts). Revisions PENDING until pinned on the pod."
